# svc-name-rater (party picks by scripts): the Name Rater in Eterna City
# Condominiums 1F opens the party menu to pick a Pokémon (select_move_tutor_pokemon, read back by
# get_selected_party_slot). The first visit cancels it (PARTY_SLOT_NONE: "Please come visit again"); the
# second picks Bidoof, says yes to a better name and renames it on the naming keyboard.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_TURTWIG 12
party 1 platinum:SPECIES_BIDOOF 8
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ETERNA_CITY_CONDOMINIUMS_1F 7 10 right
until idle
# First visit: YES, then B in the party menu
+1 press a
+1 release a
advance text
+0 assert state party[1].nickname null
until yesno
+0 press a
+1 release a
# "Which Pokémon's nickname should I critique?" waits for A or B without an arrow (wait_ab_press)
until message 600
+0 press a
+1 release a
until app party
+0 assert app party
+1 press b
+1 release b
until app none
advance text
until idle
+0 assert state party[1].nickname null
# Second visit: pick Bidoof (slot 1) by tap
+1 press a
+1 release a
advance text
+0 assert state party[1].nickname null
until yesno
+0 press a
+1 release a
# "Which Pokémon's nickname should I critique?" waits for A or B without an arrow (wait_ab_press)
until message 600
+0 press a
+1 release a
until app party
+0 screenshot pick
+1 tap slot:1
until app none
# "Give it a better name?" YES, then the naming screen
advance text
until yesno
+0 press a
+1 release a
# "What shall the new nickname be?" (wait_ab_press)
+150 press a
+1 release a
until app naming
+1 tap type:Bido
+1 tap ok
until app none
advance text
until idle
+0 assert state party[1].nickname "Bido"
+0 assert state party[0].nickname null
